{"1732420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spanky!", "steam_appid": 1732420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2935740], "detailed_description": "<h1>FUTURE UPDATES</h1><p></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Grab some friends and clap your cheeks together as you spank booty through various chaotic party modes, striving to become the <strong>Spanky Champion!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The aim of the game is simple! Slap ass!</strong></h2>Jiggle and bounce through endlessly generated party games, where each mode offers a unique challenge for you to conquer. Combine powers with insane booty-based movement to unleash powerful spanks that keep every game <strong>one of a kind!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/99d71effc6c2a86a52c79bdb819370bb.poster.avif?t=1716267330\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/99d71effc6c2a86a52c79bdb819370bb.webm?t=1716267330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/99d71effc6c2a86a52c79bdb819370bb.mp4?t=1716267330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement you love &amp; new tech to master!</strong></h2> Spanky! offers high skill-ceiling movement that allows you to hone your skills and demolish your opponent's cheeks. Master the art of booty schmovement as you run, climb, and spank your way through any booty that stands in your way!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/9c548c863dce521f6cbb3fd7d7fa7aa5.poster.avif?t=1716267330\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/9c548c863dce521f6cbb3fd7d7fa7aa5.webm?t=1716267330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/9c548c863dce521f6cbb3fd7d7fa7aa5.mp4?t=1716267330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Booty Loot every play session!</strong></h2>Unlock hundreds of unique customisation options! Every base cosmetic is available for you to unlock through fun and rewarding gameplay, right from the start! Level up, unlock achievements, and find secrets - all of which grant rewards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/d4a54c27351ae3dec24d133dcfb3bc41.poster.avif?t=1716267330\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/d4a54c27351ae3dec24d133dcfb3bc41.webm?t=1716267330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732420/extras/d4a54c27351ae3dec24d133dcfb3bc41.mp4?t=1716267330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Our famous scientist Albooty Heinstein just did the math, and turns out that with every cosmetic option available there are ~50,848,869,120 possible combinations...</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>300+ FREE cosmetics to unlock through gameplay!<br></li><li>Insanely unique booty powers to master. Slap ass with the Aimbutt, or run faster than lightning with a Bum Buff!<br></li><li>Easy to handle movement with extreme speed and a high skill-ceiling<br></li><li>20+ base maps - More added with each update!<br></li><li>Champion mode! Play back-to-back games earning points for performance and placement, the winner grabs the cheek crown first!<br